~~
Arrays Test

This test validates:
1. Array literals and index access
2. Custom type definitions using type.edit
3. Custom write modifiers using write.edit
~~

~ ManyString
let MString type.edit { .name: "string", .is_many: true }

~ Array literal and index access
let nums :MString ["Hello", "Array"]
write nums[0]
write nums[1]

~ Expected Terminal Output:
~ Hello
~ Array
